DTEND:20261006T223000
DTSTAMP:20261006T174442Z
UID:413473a2ac02ff05fe62d8b776ad47@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Recent national news involving college students has raised dif
 ficult questions about sexual violence\, consent\, responsibility\, and wh
 at it means to care for one another in community. Join the SPEECH Peer Edu
 cators for a facilitated conversation and an opportunity to process togeth
 er\, ask questions\, and consider what these issues mean for our own campu
 s community. Space is limited. Pre-registration on myHC required. --- Even
 t Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154851 Source: College of t
 he Holy Cross Event page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154851\n\nEv
