 it)\, Executive Director and Chief Curator\, The Forge Project Ilona Katze
 w\, Curator and Department Head\, Latin American Art\, Los Angeles County 
 Museum of Art Stephanie Sparling Williams\, Andrew W. Mellon Curator of Am
 erican Art\, Head of American Art\, Brooklyn Museum Horace D. Ballard (mod
 erator)\, Theodore E. Stebbins\, Jr.\, Curator of American Art Frances Yee
  ’28 (moderator)\, Terra Foundation Undergraduate Student Research Assis
 tant in American Art LEARN MORE Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://w
