BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Worcester October Community Meeting
DTSTART:20261009T000000
DTEND:20261009T000000
DTSTAMP:20261006T174442Z
UID:20da0453be0a56f7d225e12cd47f77@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:This month\, we’re going behind the mural! Join us for our O
 ctober Downtown Worcester Community Meeting on Friday\, October 9\, from 9
  to 10 am at the YWCA of Central Massachusetts (1 Salem Square). We’ll s
 tart the morning in the YWCA Board Room\, where CEO Deb Hall will share a 
 bit about the YWCA’s work and mission in our community\, and introduce u
 s to its new "Worcester Wall of Women." Created by local artists Sharinna 
 Travieso and Jennessa Burks\, the mural brings the stories and faces of Wo
 rcester women to Francis J. McGrath Boulevard. Sharinna will join us to sh
 are more about the project\, the process of bringing it to life\, and the 
 significance of adding this new work of public art to Worcester’s landsc
 ape. Then\, we’ll take a short walk around the corner to see the finishe
 d mural together! It’s a chance to get to know an important Downtown org
 anization\, meet one of the artists behind a new piece of Worcester public
  art\, learn something about Downtown you didn’t know before\, and make 
 a connection or two along the way. We want our Community Meetings to be us
 eful to you\, too. Looking for information\, resources\, or introduction? 
 Want to meet more of the people who live\, work\, own businesses\, and spe
 nd time Downtown? Come — and let us know! We want to help make those con
 nections happen. Whether you’ve been to every Downtown Worcester Communi
 ty Meeting to date or you’ve never joined us before\, this is your invit
 ation. Come explore. Meet someone new. Learn something new about Downtown.
  Bring a friend or colleague. And\, as always\, complimentary breakfast an
 d coffee are on us! Downtown Worcester Community Meetings are free and ope
 n to everyone. Register by Thursday\, October 8: https://lp.constantcontac
 tpages.com/ev/reg/tyktkmk We’d love to see you there! Sources: Discover 
 Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/
 downtown-worcester-october-community-meeting/30682/\n\nEvents Near Me: wit
 hin 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from ma
 ssachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/eve
 nt/downtown-worcester-october-community-meeting/30682/
LOCATION:1 Salem Square\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/downtown-worcester-october-com
 munity-meeting/30682/
END:VEVENT
