UID:57c6b118bc9c07506973320bdf6179@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:🔥 WOMEN OF MASSACHUSETTS: TORCH IS COMING 🔥 What happens
  when women from different backgrounds come together in one room to talk o
 penly about the issues affecting women and girls? TORCH. TORCH is a femini
 st conference taking place in Worcester\, Massachusetts\, bringing women t
 ogether for discussion\, networking\, organizing\, education\, and communi
 ty. This isn't another online argument. It's an opportunity to actually me
 et people. If you're a feminist\, activist\, organizer\, writer\, research
 er\, student\, or simply a woman who wants to connect with other women who
  take these issues seriously\, come to TORCH. 📍 WORCESTER\, MASSACHUSET
 TS 🔥 TORCH FEMINIST CONFERENCE 🎟️ TICKETS ARE AVAILABLE NOW ⚠️
  DON'T JUST WATCH FROM THE SIDELINES. Bring a friend. Share this post. Tel
 l your local women's organizations. Get the word out. The conference only 
 happens if women actually show up. 🎟️ GET YOUR TICKETS https://www.ev
 entbrite.com/e/torch-feminist-conference-tickets-1994746576708 --- 🛡️
  HELP KEEP TORCH SECURE We are also raising funds for conference security 
 and safety preparations. Every share matters. Every attendee matters. Ever
 y contribution helps. 🔥 TORCH — WORCESTER\, MA 🔥 Don't just talk a
 bout building a women's movement. Show up. Sources: Discover Central Massa
 chusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/torch-by-tota
 l-woman-victory/30970/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough
 \, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSour
 ce page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/torch-by-total-woman-vict
 ory/30970/
LOCATION:Worcester State Conference & Event Services\, 486 Chandler St.\, 
 Worcester\, MA\, 01602
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/torch-by-total-woman-victory/3
 0970/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Airplane! Live
DTSTART:20261010T000000
DTEND:20261010T000000
DTSTAMP:20261006T174442Z
UID:8c9bceabcedbdf72a857187c28e6a5@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Airplane! Live with Julie Hagerty and Robert Hays! You ever se
 en a… screening of the greatest comedy to ever hit the skies? Well surel
 y you’ve seen Airplane! — but not like this! We have clearance\, Clare
 nce\, to show the beloved comedy classic\, Airplane! on the BIG screen joi
 ned live by two stars of the film! Assuming they don’t have the fish for
  dinner… Robert Hays (reluctant pilot “Ted Striker”) and Julie Hager
 ty (flight attendant “Elaine Dickinson”) will take the stage for a liv
 e discussion and Q&A after the film to share behind-the-scenes stories\, i
 nsights\, and personal memories from working on this genre-defining comedy
  masterpiece. So put down that glue\, because SURELY this is the wrong wee
 k to miss Robert Hays & Julie Hagerty with a screening of Airplane! (And d
 on’t call them Shirley!) Act quick: A limited number of passengers can u
 pgrade to a “First Class” VIP meet & greet experience! VIPs will meet 
 Julie Hagerty and Robert Hays\, pose with them for a professionally shot p
 hotograph\, and receive an autographed tour poster! This post-show VIP mee
 t & greet opportunity is available while supplies last. The VIP add-on is 
 not valid without an accompanying show ticket and each attendee must have 
 both for entry to the VIP meet & greet. Sources: Discover Central Massachu
 setts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/airplane!-live/2
 9890/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDisco
 very: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://w
 ww.discovercentralma.org/event/airplane!-live/29890/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/airplane!-live/29890/
END:VEVENT
