UID:52bae29a4505d98dc68a244dc0dde9@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Chameleon opens its 29th season with early inspirations of com
 posers who became defining voices of their generations. Britten’s Phanta
 sy Quartet blends English pastoral charm with his blossoming modernist sen
 sibility\, Carter brings playful counterpoint and melodic warmth to his pi
 votal neoclassic Wind Quintet\, and Cage offers an enchanting Nocturne tha
 t leaves nothing to chance. Beethoven’s A Major Violin Sonata frees us f
 rom Classical molds with quicksilver charm\, and Strauss’ glorious Piano
  Quartet soars with glimpses of heroes’ journeys to come. LEARN MORE / G
 ET TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/eve
 nt/i-dwell-in-possibility/92651/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Nor
 thborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.
