BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CTEQ: Fortin & Gonthier Lecture
DTSTART:20261014T170000
DTEND:20261014T183000
DTSTAMP:20261006T174442Z
UID:94d651cb222c3e4e249a5db44d816e@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, the Fortin & Gonthier Lecture brings a distinguish
 ed visiting scholar to campus to address a theme central to the educationa
 l mission of the CTEQ Program. This year’s lecture will be delivered by 
 Diana Schaub\, Professor of Political Science at Loyola University Marylan
 d. We hope you will join us for this year’s lecture on Wednesday\, Octob
 er 14 at 5:00 p.m. in Curtis Performance Hall. This event is sponsored by 
 the Core Texts and Enduring Questions (CTEQ) and is part of Assumption’s
  year-long series celebrating the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of 
 Independence\, Striving for Life\, Liberty\, and the Pursuit of Happiness.
  Source: Assumption University Event page: https://www.assumption.edu/news
 -and-events/events/cteq-fortin-gonthier-lecture\n\nEvents Near Me: within 
 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from worces
 ter-colleges-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-
 events/events/cteq-fortin-gonthier-lecture
