BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MVP - One Love Workshop
DTSTART:20261021T180000
DTEND:20261021T190000
DTSTAMP:20261006T174442Z
UID:fe51842a3d21a536570efcb69a21ad@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Miles tries to balance his basketball life with the possessive
  demands of his girlfriend\, Jess. MVP is a film that focuses on the ways 
 healthy and unhealthy relationship behaviors can influence our romantic re
 lationships\, friendships\, and daily activities. We specifically see how 
 Miles\, a star basketball player\, experiences unhealthy behaviors from hi
 s girlfriend\, Jess\, challenging traditional stereotypes about who is aff
 ected by relationship abuse. We will explore the 10 signs of a healthy and
  unhealthy relationship from One Love Foundation. Content Disclosure: This
  event will include discussion of topics related to relationship violence.
  We encourage participants to take care of themselves and engage with the 
 conversation in whatever way feels most comfortable. --- Event Details: ht
 tps://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154157 Source: College of the Holy Cross
  Event page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154157\n\nEvents Near Me:
  within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback fro
 m worcester-colleges-events.ics\nSource page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/r
 svp?id=2154157
LOCATION:Dinand Library - Levis Browsing Room of Dinand Library\, The Coll
 ege of the Holy Cross\, Hogan Campus Center- Suite 506\, Worcester\, MA 01
 610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2154157
END:VEVENT
