 es. "Questiones et Dubia" is focused on explaining challenging parts of Ca
 tholic Church doctrine and allowing us all to discuss and ask questions so
  as to further deepen our faith. Dinner will\, as always\, be provided. Th
 is event will take place in the Williams Social Space\, which is located o
 n the first floor of Williams Hall. Someone will be at the front door of W
 illiams to direct you to the room. All are welcome! --- Event Details: htt
